# apps/web/.env.example
# docs: 10-local-development.md#env
# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored).
#
# Leave VITE_API_BASE_URL UNSET for local + LAN dev: the app auto-targets the page's
# own host on :8080 (so http://<laptop-ip>:5173 on a phone calls http://<laptop-ip>:8080).
# Set it explicitly ONLY for production builds, pointing at your Cloud Run URL:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://mirror-realm-api-xxxx.a.run.app
